ATTRIBUTION & UPSTREAM DATA SOURCES:

1. Open-Source Geographic & Classification Reference Patterns:
   Portions of the static maritime chokepoint coordinates, global financial center
   registries, nuclear facility reference points, submarine cable metadata, and
   ICAO 24-bit military hex/callsign heuristics are adapted from:
   - koala73/worldmonitor (https://github.com/koala73/worldmonitor) — Licensed under GNU AGPL-3.0.

2. Live Upstream Public Data Providers (fetched directly from origin):
   - Military Aviation ADS-B: adsb.lol (https://api.adsb.lol)
   - Seismic Activity: USGS Earthquake Hazards Program (https://earthquake.usgs.gov)
   - Natural Events & Disasters: NASA EONET (https://eonet.gsfc.nasa.gov) & UN/EC GDACS (https://www.gdacs.org)
   - Geopolitical Events: GDELT Project 2.0 (https://www.gdeltproject.org)
   - Weather Radar Imagery: RainViewer (https://www.rainviewer.com)
   - Macroeconomic Indicators: The World Bank Open Data API v2 (https://data.worldbank.org)
   - Crypto, Sentiment & FX: CoinGecko, CoinPaprika, Alternative.me Fear & Greed, ExchangeRate-API (open.er-api.com), European Central Bank
   - Prediction Markets: Polymarket Gamma API (https://polymarket.com)
   - Basemap Vector Tiles: CARTO Basemaps & OpenStreetMap Contributors
